[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles External GUI SW Verification Test Protocol
UID: DHF-HRC-0047-TP
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: heracles-external-gui

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document provides the verification test protocol and execution results of the External GUI SW for the Heracles system. It defines the test cases that are used to verify the compliance of the software with the Heracles External GUI SW Verification Plan and Software Requirements Specification.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document details all regression test cases for the Verification testing activities of Heracles External GUI Software. Each test case is designed to verify specific functional, interface, and usability requirements of the system, including treatment control, quality assurance, and operational workflows.
<<<

