[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-285
TITLE: Quality Assurance - Audit users' actions
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies that system actions are properly logged and audited. It validates that the audit trail accurately records user actions and data modifications.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Log in to the External application.

2. Navigate to the Beam QA Checks tab in the Quality Assurance view.

3. Select Energy 50/70/100 in the Energy drop-down.

