[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-116
TITLE: Treatment View - Database Communication Error
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies proper error handling and reporting. It validates that appropriate error messages are displayed and logged when system errors occur.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
The database connection is available at test start and can be interrupted safely.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Log in to the External application. 

2. Navigate to the treatment view. 

3. Press the Prepare button to prepare the treatment. 

4. Press the Beam-On button to trigger emission delivery. 

5. Interrupt the application's database connection during the emission.

6. Go to Log view.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
6 - The application shall notify the operator that database communication was lost,
and the same communication error shall be displayed in the log list.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-288
  ROLE: Verifies

