[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-293
TITLE: Physics View - Emission Process
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies radiation emission control and safety. It validates that emission parameters are correctly managed and safety limits are enforced.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
