5. Enter duration of 10 sec. 

6. Press the Prepare button. 

7. Press Beam On button
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
6 - The interface should display the following states: 

System status: WARMUP 

Button's label: Warming up ( with progress bar) 

then System status: HVSetup ( On Loading) 

Upon completion of the preparation process: 

System status: READY 

7 - The button label should transition to "Launching", and subsequently to "Beaming on" with a progress bar. 

System status at the top of the screen should be "Emission". 

Upon completion, a pop-up message should be displayed to confirm successful emission.
<<<
