[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-100
TITLE: Quality Assurance - Quality Checks Reports - (UI) Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case is designed to verify that the application provide the operator with an interface displaying the history of quality test results.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
Conduct quality checks within the system prior to conducting this test
<<<
STEPS: >>>
Test Steps: 

1.Launch Heracles External 

2.Click the Quality Assurance tab 

3.Inside the Quality Assurance tab, click the Quality Checks tab
<<<
